  "details": "When I change avatars. They just suddenly stop tracking my movement. My hands and head are still tracked in game. My menu appears at my hand normally. But my avatar moves as if i am still in desktop mode. If i look down or up depending on the size of the character. I see my avatar walking with it’s default animation. In some cases it just get’s stuck with no animation. I can move around and everything. But my avatar doesn’t follow my movements. My head is at the wrong position and my expression button is greyed out. I have found no information on this problem elsewhere.",
